From ec0915f5f7b12319026a64f34704fb795fef3dfe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TekRantGaming <craigferels896@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 14:33:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] D3D12: unnormalized fetch coordinates at the fetched mip
 level, integer resolve destinations

Unnormalized texture coordinates with a register LOD are texels of that mip level. Resolves to 16 bpp formats with
an integer destination number format store integers. Both are used by the Trials Fusion virtual texture page table.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
